Name: BandLock (RootHide LTE Scan Test)
Version: 1.5.1~rhscan1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Experimental opt-in RootHide two-band LTE scan with typed signal readings, durable journal and automatic restore attempts. Cellular and emergency calling may be interrupted. Not a public release.
